{
  "schemaVersion": 4,
  "source": "修伞簿",
  "episodes": [
    {
      "ep": 1,
      "targetSeconds": 60,
      "openingBeat": [
        1,
        1
      ],
      "beatClaims": [
        {
          "beatId": "B01",
          "start": [
            1,
            3
          ],
          "end": [
            2,
            2
          ]
        },
        {
          "beatId": "B02",
          "start": [
            2,
            3
          ],
          "end": [
            2,
            8
          ]
        }
      ],
      "scenes": [
        {
          "sceneId": "S01",
          "lighting": "下午自然光",
          "characters": [
            "C01",
            "C02"
          ],
          "props": [
            "P01"
          ],
          "flow": [
            {
              "action": "陈岚把旧伞放在工作台上，蓝线缠在断骨旁。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 6,
                  "endLine": 6
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C02",
              "line": "伞面还好，就是这根骨头撑不住了。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 7,
                  "endLine": 7
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "林禾扶住伞骨，顺着蓝线摸到一个反折的线结。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 8,
                  "endLine": 8
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C01",
              "line": "这个结我小时候见过。伞是谁修过的？",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 9,
                  "endLine": 9
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C02",
              "line": "很多年前的事了，我得回去问问家里人。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 10,
                  "endLine": 10
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "林禾把伞放平，取出一根尺寸合适的替换伞骨。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 11,
                  "endLine": 11
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C01",
              "line": "先不急着问。我把它修好，你晚上还要走路。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 12,
                  "endLine": 12
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "陈岚在门边坐下，林禾将断骨放进废料盒。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 13,
                  "endLine": 13
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C02",
              "line": "旧线还能留下吗？不是值钱，只是一直没换。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 14,
                  "endLine": 14
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "林禾把蓝线绕回新伞骨，留着原来的线结。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 15,
                  "endLine": 15
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sceneId": "S01",
          "lighting": "傍晚自然光",
          "characters": [
            "C01",
            "C02"
          ],
          "props": [
            "P01"
          ],
          "flow": [
            {
              "action": "傍晚，陈岚站到台前，林禾慢慢撑开修好的伞。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 17,
                  "endLine": 17
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C01",
              "line": "能留下。新的骨头不妨碍原来的线结。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 18,
                  "endLine": 18
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C02",
              "line": "你刚才看了很久，是想找什么人吗？",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 19,
                  "endLine": 19
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "林禾停下擦拭，把伞柄转向陈岚。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 20,
                  "endLine": 20
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C01",
              "line": "想找我母亲。但相同的纹路，不能算认出了人。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 21,
                  "endLine": 21
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C02",
              "line": "明天我经过这里，你愿意的话，我来告诉你。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 22,
                  "endLine": 22
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C01",
              "line": "谢谢。只问你愿意说的，修伞的钱还是原价。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 23,
                  "endLine": 23
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "陈岚接过伞。林禾在预约页写下明天下午，合上账本。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 24,
                  "endLine": 24
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ep": 2,
      "targetSeconds": 60,
      "beatClaims": [
        {
          "beatId": "B03",
          "start": [
            1,
            3
          ],
          "end": [
            2,
            2
          ]
        },
        {
          "beatId": "B04",
          "start": [
            2,
            3
          ],
          "end": [
            2,
            8
          ]
        }
      ],
      "scenes": [
        {
          "sceneId": "S01",
          "lighting": "下午自然光",
          "characters": [
            "C01",
            "C02"
          ],
          "props": [
            "P02",
            "P03"
          ],
          "flow": [
            {
              "action": "林禾翻开修伞簿，同样的绕线图出现在几个不同名字旁。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 27,
                  "endLine": 27
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C01",
              "line": "我昨晚找到了旧簿，这个结不只一个人会打。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 28,
                  "endLine": 28
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "陈岚把带来的伞套放在桌角，看着那几幅线图。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 29,
                  "endLine": 29
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C02",
              "line": "教大家的人叫许秋。我的伞，是她修的。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 30,
                  "endLine": 30
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C01",
              "line": "你知道她住哪里吗？我可以自己去问她。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 31,
                  "endLine": 31
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "陈岚收回正要指向簿页的手，坐到林禾对面。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 32,
                  "endLine": 32
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C02",
              "line": "知道，但我没问过她，不能替她把地址告诉你。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 33,
                  "endLine": 33
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "林禾看着簿页上不同的签名，把夹着的地图抽出来。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 34,
                  "endLine": 34
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C01",
              "line": "你说得对。会打同一个结，也不能证明什么。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 35,
                  "endLine": 35
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "林禾把地图收进抽屉，另取一张没有写过的纸。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 36,
                  "endLine": 36
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sceneId": "S01",
          "lighting": "傍晚自然光",
          "characters": [
            "C01",
            "C02"
          ],
          "props": [
            "P02",
            "P03"
          ],
          "flow": [
            {
              "action": "陈岚整理伞套，林禾在纸上写下自己的名字和电话。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 38,
                  "endLine": 38
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C01",
              "line": "这张是我的电话。请你问问，她愿不愿意收下。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 39,
                  "endLine": 39
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C02",
              "line": "如果她不想见，你能等我回来说完吗？",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 40,
                  "endLine": 40
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "林禾把纸条翻过来，补上可以不回复的说明。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 41,
                  "endLine": 41
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C01",
              "line": "可以。不愿意也是答复，不必替我劝她。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 42,
                  "endLine": 42
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C02",
              "line": "那我只替你转交，不替你答应别的事情。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 43,
                  "endLine": 43
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C01",
              "line": "谢谢你。簿子留在这里，等我有把握再翻。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 44,
                  "endLine": 44
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "陈岚收好纸条离开。林禾合上地图抽屉，没有追出去。",
              "sourceRefs": [
                {
                  "documentId": "umbrella",
                  "startLine": 45,
                  "endLine": 45
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ep": 3,
      "targetSeconds": 60,
      "openingBeat": [
        1,
        1
      ],
      "beatClaims": [
        {
          "beatId": "B05",
          "start": [
            1,
